b style="font-weight:bold;">Total contractual obligations</b></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:1.69%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">&#160;</b></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:9.93%;border-bottom:1px solid #000000;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:right;margin:0pt 3pt 0pt 0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;"> <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_HeGFnztaUESwmwhdTLq9LA" contextRef="As_Of_9_30_2024_3Rz0r8n1b0i6p2SS894NKA" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="ifrs-full:FinancialLiabilities" scale="0" id="Tc_zf111EdKIkuDyLmCkU8Trw_6_2">1,439,286</ix:nonFraction></b></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:1.7%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:right;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:9.84%;border-bottom:1px solid #000000;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:right;margin:0pt 3pt 0pt 0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;"> <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_HeGFnztaUESwmwhdTLq9LA" contextRef="As_Of_9_30_2024_3Rz0r8n1b0i6p2SS894NKA" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="pbm:FinancialLiabilitiesUndiscountedCashFlows" scale="0" id="Tc_2Njv4PG5T0u7QqC7d72ZZA_6_4">1,467,231</ix:nonFraction></b></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:1.7%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:right;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:9.84%;border-bottom:1px solid #000000;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:right;margin:0pt 3pt 0pt 0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;"> <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_HeGFnztaUESwmwhdTLq9LA" contextRef="As_Of_9_30_2024_ifrs-full_MaturityAxis_ifrs-full_NotLaterThanOneYearMember_xSmB5d3KLU6j_M0Ov-j5XA" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="pbm:FinancialLiabilitiesUndiscountedCashFlows" scale="0" id="Tc_BqcYl5E-mk2-gHLX-FYKKg_6_6">1,467,231</ix:nonFraction></b></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:1.7%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:right;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:9.84%;border-bottom:1px solid #000000;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:right;margin:0pt 3pt 0pt 0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;"> &#8212;</b></p></td></tr></table></ix:nonNumeric><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-weight:bold;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:italic;margin:0pt 0pt 10pt 0pt;">Interest rate risk</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 10pt 0pt;">Interest rate risk is the risk that the fair value of future cash flows of a financial instrument will fluctuate because of changes in market interest rates. The Company has no significant interest-bearing assets or liabilities and therefore its income and operating cash flows are substantially independent of changes in market interest rates.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:italic;margin:0pt 0pt 10pt 0pt;">Foreign exchange risk</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 10pt 0pt;">Foreign currency risk is the risk that the fair values of future cash flows of a financial instrument will fluctuate because they are denominated in currencies that differ from the respective functional currency.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:18pt;margin:0pt 0pt 10pt 0pt;">As at September 30, 2024, a <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_csGVPTI6LEiHjYWu44qMSw" contextRef="As_Of_9_30_2024_3Rz0r8n1b0i6p2SS894NKA" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="pbm:PercentageOfReasonablyPossibleChangeInRiskAssumption" scale="-2" id="Narr_A4O5j9hXyUu4liXnT3MHqQ">10</ix:nonFraction>% fluctuation in foreign exchange rates would result in a $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_HeGFnztaUESwmwhdTLq9LA" contextRef="Duration_4_1_2024_To_9_30_2024_7K5_E20a7kOIviXv5d41-A" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="pbm:IncreaseDecreaseInProfitOrLossDueToReasonablyPossibleChangeInDesignatedRiskComponent" scale="0" id="Narr_NssjTJp0l0GLXOrJdcsJEQ">21,021</ix:nonFraction> impact to net loss and comprehensive loss.</p></ix:continuation><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_4_1_2024_To_9_30_2024_7K5_E20a7kOIviXv5d41-A" name="ifrs-full:DisclosureOfEventsAfterReportingPeriodExplanatory" id="Tb_8BZ41QtkekmzNi5AAwMqRQ" continuedAt="Tb_8BZ41QtkekmzNi5AAwMqRQ_cont1" escape="true"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-weight:bold;margin:0pt 0pt 10pt 0pt;">18. Subsequent Events</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 10pt 0pt;">Subsequent to period end, the Company has received gross proceeds of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_HeGFnztaUESwmwhdTLq9LA" contextRef="Duration_10_1_2024_To_10_1_2024_ifrs-full_NonadjustingEventsAfterReportingPeriodAxis_pbm_IfrsConvertibleDebtMember_wtstNttRGESGCSJ-MYT6kw" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="pbm:IncreaseDecreaseThroughEquityLineOfCreditEquity" scale="0" id="Narr_t0tSmDPzA0uXJ_mntbZbhA">4,786,568</ix:nonFraction> for the issuance of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_pvyiikKkpUa41tyBo3imug" contextRef="Duration_10_1_2024_To_10_1_2024_ifrs-full_NonadjustingEventsAfterReportingPeriodAxis_pbm_IfrsConvertibleDebtMember_wtstNttRGESGCSJ-MYT6kw" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="pbm:StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesEquityLineOfCredit" scale="0" id="Narr_Kwt9CLB830C46sbFtZDqXA">1,557,035</ix:nonFraction> common shares in relation to the ELOC.</p></ix:nonNumeric></div></div><div style="clear:both;margin-bottom:30pt;width:100%;"><table style="border-collapse:collapse;font-size:16pt;height:max-content;table-layout:fixed;width:100%;"><tr style="height:1pt;"><td style="vertical-align:top;width:33.33%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt 5.4pt 0pt 5.4pt;"><div style="height:1pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;position:relative;"><div style="position:absolute;top:0pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:24pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"><span style="font-size:1pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></div></div></td><td style="vertical-align:top;width:33.34%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt 5.4pt 0pt 5.4pt;"><div style="height:1pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;position:relative;"><div style="position:absolute;top:0pt;width:100%;"></div></div></td><td style="vertical-align:top;width:33.32%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt 5.4pt 0pt 5.4pt;"><div style="height:1pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;position:relative;"><div style="position:absolute;top:0pt;width:100%;"></div></div></td></tr><tr><td style="vertical-align:top;width:33.33%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt 5.4pt 0pt 5.4pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:right;margin:24pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align:top;width:33.34%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt 5.4pt 0pt 5.4pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:12pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"><img src="pbm-20240930xex99d1002.jpg" alt="Graphic" style="display:inline-block;height:60.38pt;left:0%;padding-bottom:0pt;position:relative;top:0pt;width:87.84pt;"/></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;width:33.32%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt 5.4pt 0pt 5.4pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:right;margin:24pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;">20</p></td></tr></table><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-size:1pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></div></div>
<div style="background-color:#000000;clear:both;height:2pt;page-break-after:always;width:88.24%;border:0;margin:30pt 5.88% 30pt 5.88%;"></div><div style="max-width:100%;padding-left:5.88%;padding-right:5.88%;position:relative;"><div style="margin-top:30pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="text-decoration-line:none;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><table style="border-collapse:collapse;font-size:16pt;height:max-content;table-layout:fixed;width:100%;"><tr style="height:1pt;"><td style="vertical-align:top;width:100%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><div style="height:1pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;position:relative;"><div style="position:absolute;top:0pt;width:100%;"></div></div></td></tr><tr><td style="vertical-align:top;width:100%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">PSYENCE BIOMEDICAL LTD.</b></p></td></tr><tr><td style="vertical-align:top;width:100%;border-bottom:1px solid #000000;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">Condensed Consolidated Interim Financial Statements (unaudited)</b></p></td></tr></table><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="text-decoration-line:none;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></div><div style="clear:both;margin-left:-10.0pt;margin-right:-10.0pt;max-width:100%;position:relative;width:calc(100% + 20.0pt);"><div style="padding-left:10pt;padding-right:10pt;position:relative;width:100%;"><ix:continuation id="Tb_8BZ41QtkekmzNi5AAwMqRQ_cont1"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 10pt 0pt;">On October 25, 2024, for the PGI promissory note which had a remaining principal balance of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_HeGFnztaUESwmwhdTLq9LA" contextRef="Duration_10_25_2024_To_10_25_2024_ifrs-full_BorrowingsByNameAxis_pbm_UnsecuredConvertiblePromissoryNotesMember_ifrs-full_CategoriesOfRelatedPartiesAxis_ifrs-full_ParentMember_ifrs-full_NonadjustingEventsAfterReportingPeriodAxis_pbm_IfrsConvertibleDebtMember_uLbglwKa-kqCUrPn6Dl1VA" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="pbm:IfrsDebtConversionOriginalDebtAmount1" scale="0" id="Narr_Y_6fqV-czEmbko7gTii23g">422,697</ix:nonFraction> was converted into <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_pvyiikKkpUa41tyBo3imug" contextRef="Duration_10_25_2024_To_10_25_2024_ifrs-full_BorrowingsByNameAxis_pbm_UnsecuredConvertiblePromissoryNotesMember_ifrs-full_CategoriesOfRelatedPartiesAxis_ifrs-full_ParentMember_ifrs-full_NonadjustingEventsAfterReportingPeriodAxis_pbm_IfrsConvertibleDebtMember_uLbglwKa-kqCUrPn6Dl1VA" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="pbm:IfrsDebtConversionConvertedInstrumentSharesIssued1" scale="0" id="Narr_ngyxSWw-7UqClG_kFp--eA">11,272</ix:nonFraction> common shares.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 10pt 0pt;">On October 28, 2024, the Company acquired <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_pvyiikKkpUa41tyBo3imug" contextRef="Duration_10_28_2024_To_10_28_2024_ifrs-full_NonadjustingEventsAfterReportingPeriodAxis_pbm_ReverseMergerAgreementMember_LLrxeL-l2E2obhoGt5NDHw" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="pbm:NumberOfSharesAcquired" scale="0" id="Narr_pvJMqWR3XkyEFbHnG6-iJw">1,000</ix:nonFraction> shares in Psyence Labs Ltd (Psy Labs) from PGI. PsyLabs is a private company headquartered in the BVI. PsyLabs is focused on the production of psychedelic active pharmaceutical ingredients and extracts. The Company issued <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_pvyiikKkpUa41tyBo3imug" contextRef="Duration_10_28_2024_To_10_28_2024_ifrs-full_NonadjustingEventsAfterReportingPeriodAxis_pbm_ReverseMergerAgreementMember_LLrxeL-l2E2obhoGt5NDHw" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="pbm:StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesIssuedForReverseTakeoverTransaction" scale="0" id="Narr_vkazA5WVsU-DUqWxWj4D-g">26,667</ix:nonFraction> common shares at a price of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_I9kD_MQ8ME-OHUtxweJqhw" contextRef="As_Of_10_28_2024_ifrs-full_NonadjustingEventsAfterReportingPeriodAxis_pbm_ReverseMergerAgreementMember_OoDjZpJlOUqS9HeTfBfNtA" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="pbm:IfrsSharePrice" scale="0" id="Narr_uNzK9oV4UEOYUdBBYqw2Vg">41.25</ix:nonFraction> per share in exchange for the shares in Psy Labs. There was also a make whole provision which entitled PGI to a top-up in shares if the share price at January 15, 2025 was lower than the share price on October 28, 2024.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 10pt 0pt;">On November 26, 2024, the Company consolidated its common shares on the basis of <span style="-sec-ix-hidden:Hidden_tPLWRLHc8E-TTyvERXUuyw;"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">75</span></span>:1.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 10pt 0pt;">On November 27, 2024, the Company issued <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_pvyiikKkpUa41tyBo3imug" contextRef="Duration_11_27_2024_To_11_27_2024_ifrs-full_BorrowingsByNameAxis_pbm_IfrsConvertibleDebtMember_ifrs-full_NonadjustingEventsAfterReportingPeriodAxis_pbm_IfrsConvertibleDebtMember_dmDYl0aYAkOlGpqJIscOag" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="pbm:WarrantsIssuedNumber" scale="0" id="Narr__6qZ2qWEPEW6FWmobhZmrw">182,323</ix:nonFraction> warrants with a nominal exercise price and <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_pvyiikKkpUa41tyBo3imug" contextRef="Duration_11_27_2024_To_11_27_2024_ifrs-full_BorrowingsByNameAxis_pbm_IfrsConvertibleDebtMember_ifrs-full_NonadjustingEventsAfterReportingPeriodAxis_pbm_IfrsConvertibleDebtMember_dmDYl0aYAkOlGpqJIscOag" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="pbm:StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesIssuedForDebtSettlement" scale="0" id="Narr_dyopaQBP70Wk6j1bQfsWmw">151,010</ix:nonFraction> common shares in full and final settlement of all provisions under the convertible note.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 10pt 0pt;">On December 9, 2024 the Company issued to PGI <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_pvyiikKkpUa41tyBo3imug" contextRef="Duration_12_9_2024_To_12_9_2024_ifrs-full_BorrowingsByNameAxis_pbm_UnsecuredConvertiblePromissoryNotesMember_ifrs-full_CategoriesOfRelatedPartiesAxis_ifrs-full_ParentMember_ifrs-full_NonadjustingEventsAfterReportingPeriodAxis_pbm_IfrsConvertibleDebtMember_lmc-M5xxJUmkK5eX8dttxQ" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="pbm:StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesIssuedForDebtSettlement" scale="0" id="Narr_LWJEBGObg0GTI_MAPBs5FA">594,771</ix:nonFraction> common shares to settle the make whole entitlements under the promissory note and purchase of shares in Psy Labs from PGI.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 10pt 0pt;">On December 9, 2024 the Company issued <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_pvyiikKkpUa41tyBo3imug" contextRef="Duration_12_9_2024_To_12_9_2024_ifrs-full_BorrowingsByNameAxis_pbm_UnsecuredConvertiblePromissoryNotesMember_ifrs-full_CategoriesOfRelatedPartiesAxis_pbm_NcacMember_ifrs-full_NonadjustingEventsAfterReportingPeriodAxis_pbm_IfrsConvertibleDebtMember__ofIXOmG_EGpCHaP2R6Vaw" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="pbm:IfrsStockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesConversionOfConvertibleSecurities" scale="0" id="Narr_Hat8ojcvUEqaM_7oj-BH6A">373,555</ix:nonFraction> common shares to settle the make whole entitlements under the NCAC promissory note. </p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 5pt 0pt;">On December 24, 2024 the Company entered into a private placement agreement with HC Wainwright. The Company received $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_HeGFnztaUESwmwhdTLq9LA" contextRef="Duration_12_24_2024_To_12_24_2024_ifrs-full_NonadjustingEventsAfterReportingPeriodAxis_ifrs-full_MajorOrdinaryShareTransactionsMember_pbm_IfrsSaleOfStockAxis_pbm_IfrsPrivatePlacementMember_iUnbtCPtOU6EHADggeIyzA" decimals="-6" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="ifrs-full:ProceedsFromIssueOfOrdinaryShares" scale="6" id="Narr_yF-294_3A0KUnhnz31cQhg">2</ix:nonFraction> million in gross proceeds for the issuance of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_pvyiikKkpUa41tyBo3imug" contextRef="Duration_12_24_2024_To_12_24_2024_ifrs-full_NonadjustingEventsAfterReportingPeriodAxis_ifrs-full_MajorOrdinaryShareTransactionsMember_pbm_IfrsSaleOfStockAxis_pbm_IfrsPrivatePlacementMember_iUnbtCPtOU6EHADggeIyzA" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="pbm:IfrsStockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesNewIssues" scale="0" id="Narr_H0gsyj-60Em41FVJtRBUaA">380,000</ix:nonFraction> common shares and <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_pvyiikKkpUa41tyBo3imug" contextRef="Duration_12_24_2024_To_12_24_2024_ifrs-full_NonadjustingEventsAfterReportingPeriodAxis_ifrs-full_MajorOrdinaryShareTransactionsMember_pbm_IfrsSaleOfStockAxis_pbm_IfrsPrivatePlacementMember_iUnbtCPtOU6EHADggeIyzA" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="pbm:WarrantsIssuedNumber" scale="0" id="Narr_o_I9vUE_j0u7olIZQm865Q">620,000</ix:nonFraction> pre-funded warrants with a nominal exercise price. In connection with the private placement, the Company issued <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_pvyiikKkpUa41tyBo3imug" contextRef="Duration_12_24_2024_To_12_24_2024_ifrs-full_ClassesOfFinancialInstrumentsAxis_pbm_WarrantsWithExercisePrice2Member_ifrs-full_NonadjustingEventsAfterReportingPeriodAxis_ifrs-full_MajorOrdinaryShareTransactionsMember_pbm_IfrsSaleOfStockAxis_pbm_IfrsPrivatePlacementMember_qF06q3jb7EGiGQrfKj9DDg" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="pbm:WarrantsIssuedNumber" scale="0" id="Narr_k4ZLGJmdXkOMwnG58tmiiQ">2,000,000</ix:nonFraction> warrants with a $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_I9kD_MQ8ME-OHUtxweJqhw" contextRef="As_Of_12_24_2024_ifrs-full_ClassesOfFinancialInstrumentsAxis_pbm_WarrantsWithExercisePrice2Member_ifrs-full_NonadjustingEventsAfterReportingPeriodAxis_ifrs-full_MajorOrdinaryShareTransactionsMember_pbm_IfrsSaleOfStockAxis_pbm_IfrsPrivatePlacementMember_mXnMzKOdrkOyKaxlJAHZvw" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="pbm:IfrsClassOfWarrantOrRightExercisePriceOfWarrantsOrRights" scale="0" id="Narr_WXmYtrjMpU67bcpWOp6YqA">2</ix:nonFraction> exercise price and <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_pvyiikKkpUa41tyBo3imug" contextRef="Duration_12_24_2024_To_12_24_2024_ifrs-full_ClassesOfFinancialInstrumentsAxis_pbm_WarrantsWithExercisePrice250Member_ifrs-full_NonadjustingEventsAfterReportingPeriodAxis_ifrs-full_MajorOrdinaryShareTransactionsMember_pbm_IfrsSaleOfStockAxis_pbm_IfrsPrivatePlacementMember_4SzOfKmSxE22oZ5NgQV1FQ" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="pbm:WarrantsIssuedNumber" scale="0" id="Narr_4DXncpUKs0Ob5LVHcJay9g">75,000</ix:nonFraction> warrants with a $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_I9kD_MQ8ME-OHUtxweJqhw" contextRef="As_Of_12_24_2024_ifrs-full_ClassesOfFinancialInstrumentsAxis_pbm_WarrantsWithExercisePrice250Member_ifrs-full_NonadjustingEventsAfterReportingPeriodAxis_ifrs-full_MajorOrdinaryShareTransactionsMember_pbm_IfrsSaleOfStockAxis_pbm_IfrsPrivatePlacementMember_hmul_MCxqkmZ3ocK4U0f8w" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="pbm:IfrsClassOfWarrantOrRightExercisePriceOfWarrantsOrRights" scale="0" id="Narr_cMkiTNlxu0SXY070qrDqFA">2.50</ix:nonFraction> exercise price.</p></ix:continuation><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></div></div><div style="clear:both;margin-bottom:30pt;width:100%;"><table style="border-collapse:collapse;font-size:16pt;height:max-content;table-layout:fixed;width:100%;"><tr style="height:1pt;"><td style="vertical-align:top;width:33.33%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt 5.4pt 0pt 5.4pt;"><div style="height:1pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;position:relative;"><div style="position:absolute;top:0pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:24pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"><span style="font-size:1pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></div></div></td><td style="vertical-align:top;width:33.34%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt 5.4pt 0pt 5.4pt;"><div style="height:1pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;position:relative;"><div style="position:absolute;top:0pt;width:100%;"></div></div></td><td style="vertical-align:top;width:33.32%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt 5.4pt 0pt 5.4pt;"><div style="height:1pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;position:relative;"><div style="position:absolute;top:0pt;width:100%;"></div></div></td></tr><tr><td style="vertical-align:top;width:33.33%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt 5.4pt 0pt 5.4pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:right;margin:24pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align:top;width:33.34%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt 5.4pt 0pt 5.4pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:12pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"><img src="pbm-20240930xex99d1002.jpg" alt="Graphic" style="display:inline-block;height:60.38pt;left:0%;padding-bottom:0pt;position:relative;top:0pt;width:87.84pt;"/></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;width:33.32%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt 5.4pt 0